T1  - A focused survey of code agent security: Attacks, defenses, and evaluation
AU  - Hu, Meng
AU  - Wang, Tianxiang
AU  - Qu, Yubin
AU  - Geng, Yitao
AU  - Wang, Hongche
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 199
SP  - 108288
